OL,3,GNEWSARace Across the World star hopes
OL,4,Ato help others affected by suicide
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Kush Burman won BBC's Race Across
OL,7,Fthe World, he wanted to use his
OL,8,Fnew-found platform to help those who
OL,9,Fhad supported him and his family after
OL,10,Fhis dad took his own life.
OL,12,FBurman opened up about his struggles on
OL,13,Fthe popular BBC show following Matt's
OL,14,Fsuicide during the coronavirus lockdown
OL,15,Fin 2020.
OL,17,F"I had no clue what was going on when I
OL,18,Fwas 14... I had zero indication," said
OL,19,Fthe 20-year-old from Liverpool.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
