OL,3,GNEWSARace Across the World star hopes
OL,4,Ato help others affected by suicide
OL,5,
OL,6,F"So it was such a surprise, but I think
OL,7,Fgoing through life now I've always got
OL,8,Fat the back of my mind, just be nice,
OL,9,Fbecause you will never know.... you
OL,10,Fcan't know unless someone directly
OL,11,Fcomes to you."
